# No `mtllib` statement at all, so ObjModelLoader takes its "no materials" branch
# and the material group name doubles as the texture string.
#
#   `panel`  resolves to a texture next to the model
#   `_`      is the explicit "no texture" marker and must become the fallback
#   default  is the implicit group for faces before the first `usemtl`
#
# The last group is named with a shader option but no material, which checks that
# the option parsing happens on the group name in this branch too.

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 1.0 0.0

v 2.0 0.0 0.0
v 3.0 0.0 0.0
v 3.0 1.0 0.0

v 4.0 0.0 0.0
v 5.0 0.0 0.0
v 5.0 1.0 0.0

f 1 2 3

usemtl panel
f 4 5 6

usemtl _
f 7 8 9
